        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. Why North Korea just fired rockets during US-South Korea military drills Asia / Pacific Issued on: 15/03/2026 - 12:36 North Korea launched multiple rockets toward a target 360 km away while Kim Jong Un observed with his daughter. The test coincides with joint US–South Korea military exercises and rising concerns about regional security. Story by Camille Corcoran. Six members of Iranian women's football team granted asylum in Australia 11/03/2026 Middle East Not \"unlikely\" some Iranian football players pressured to return from Australia 11/03/2026 Middle East Five Iranian women football players granted asylum in Australia 10/03/2026 Middle East Chinese consumers drawn to secondhand shops as spending sputters 06/03/2026 Asia / Pacific South Korean stock market plunges over potential Iran-related energy crisis 04/03/2026 Asia / Pacific A global superpower with a quiet voice: China 'not as loud or influential' beyond the Global South 04/03/2026 Asia / Pacific Death of Ali Khamenei : Pro-Iranian regime protesters attack US consulates 01/03/2026 Asia / Pacific 'Trump has a tradition of betraying his allies': Will Khamenei's death bring regime change in Iran? 01/03/2026 Asia / Pacific Why former Karabakh official Ruben Vardanyan isn't appealing his 20-year prison term in Azerbaijan 26/02/2026 Interview Asia / Pacific"
